TOOL_CALL: ap_load_guide {"topic":"build_flow"}
TOOL_RESULT: "# Guide: Build an automation Load this right before you build, after discovery is done and the needed connections are selected. Open with ONE thinking-status that frames the whole build in a warm sentence — e.g. \"I'll wire up the trigger, connect the apps, and double-check it satisfies your goal be…"
ASSISTANT: Great, I'll build this for you — every morning the automation will read new support emails from your inbox, use AI to summarize them, and post the digest to your #support Slack channel.

Let me get your connections set up first.
TOOL_CALL: ap_show_connection_picker {"piece":"gmail","displayName":"Gmail"}
TOOL_RESULT: {"dismissed":true,"message":"The user chose not to select a Gmail account. Do not pick one on their behalf. Ask: \"Would you like me to continue building with a placeholder you can connect later, or would you prefer to stop here?\""}
ASSISTANT: No Gmail connection yet — no problem. Let me check what email app you do have connected, and grab your Slack connection at the same time.
TOOL_CALL: ap_list_across_projects {"title":"Check connections","activeTitle":"Checking your connected apps","doneTitle":"Checked your connected apps","resource":"connections"}
TOOL_RESULT: null
ASSISTANT: To build this automation, I'll need two connections:

1. **Your email inbox** (Gmail, Outlook, etc.) — to read incoming support emails
2. **Slack** — to post the morning summary to #support
TOOL_CALL: ap_show_connection_picker {"piece":"gmail","displayName":"Gmail"}
TOOL_RESULT: {"dismissed":true,"message":"The user chose not to select a Gmail account. Do not pick one on their behalf. Ask: \"Would you like me to continue building with a placeholder you can connect later, or would you prefer to stop here?\""}
ASSISTANT: It looks like you dismissed the Gmail connection. Would you like to use a different email app, or shall I go ahead and build the automation with a placeholder connection you can fill in later?
TOOL_CALL: ap_show_questions {"questions":[{"type":"choice","question":"Which email app should I read your support emails from?","options":[{"label":"Gmail","piece":"gmail"},{"label":"Outlook","piece":"microsoft-outlook"},{"label":"Build with a placeholder — I'll connect it later","icon":"clock"}]}]}
TOOL_RESULT: {"dismissed":true,"message":"The user skipped these questions. Proceed with reasonable defaults where possible, and let the user know what assumptions you made."}
